            <div xml:id="m-c1390173-9cea-43a9-a87d-fcfc4eba13f2">
              <lg xml:id="m-6a67a487-9f6f-4eed-b649-a423aa4baf11">
                <l xml:id="m-5e53d879-b36f-46c4-86b2-b3c2768ccc1b" facs="#m-9f3d5562-3d24-442f-b878-be9e95a9f6bf" label="ambiguous">392</l><l xml:id="m-0f598831-d436-48c6-a545-66e423fcc8d3" facs="#m-be30d0cc-200b-4e12-9f43-4561eeedc13f" label="text-like">The Nativity of our Lord.</l><l xml:id="m-1e4cbcc2-8ac3-48da-a884-f3c60b1bb6b9" facs="#m-b25ed561-0810-4894-9e32-611b1861eca7" label="lyrics-like">Te Déum laudámus. p. 1832.</l><l xml:id="m-eadfb73c-8968-4a40-abfd-d19a954d3142" facs="#m-cac28a63-a13f-4cdc-8bac-e2f352c34533" label="lyrics-like">V. Dóminus vobiscum. K. Et cum spíritu túo.</l><l xml:id="m-6ef9a64c-bbb6-467e-adcc-a204076caad1" facs="#m-de0bc397-260d-4698-b59c-d97ce5f0a4d2" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-fd8a8d50-60d6-4a00-8cc4-05977b87b619" facs="#m-8efc2e55-961f-4915-b448-da46ae59d187" label="lyrics-like">(VOncéde, quaésumus, omnípotens! quos sub peccáti jugo vetústa sérvi¬</l><l xml:id="m-b19650c9-2c54-475e-beaf-e178845b817c" facs="#m-c98f2cf3-1935-430e-8009-b885a7f6fdaa" label="lyrics-like">L Deus: f ut nos Unigéniti tui l tus tenet. Per eúmdem Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-f3d90be9-6754-4dbc-855b-fc1d5396f750" facs="#m-605f1c71-3560-4f01-a9e4-a189b9c21faa" label="ambiguous">nova per carnem Nativitas liberet;"</l><l xml:id="m-8cd8f636-f2d3-47d0-a445-f7a43e348ab9" facs="#m-62a7b64b-a00c-49d7-8742-514623a37201" label="lyrics-like">V. Dóminus vobiscum. R. Et cum spíritu túo.</l><l xml:id="m-a96a3c93-9bce-49e0-86df-537e4e131f6d" facs="#m-65d357ca-40c4-4a97-a4c2-88edb3042dbc" label="lyrics-like">The Cantors : N. Benedicámus Dómino. R. Déo grátias. as at Lauds</l><l xml:id="m-3916910b-bca3-45ea-84be-dd616afa3240" facs="#m-df0c1cdb-69fb-47b8-85d7-10d30a636440" label="text-like">on Solemn Feasts, p. 124.</l><l xml:id="m-593949b6-ec63-4d6f-96db-670560ca0e52" facs="#m-20928f6a-c156-4739-806a-86d2dc0476b8" label="lyrics-like">After the N. Benedicámus Dómino. the Mass of Midnight is celebrated.</l><l xml:id="m-6264849d-64b2-4b3c-9e3b-7d900f3049ae" facs="#m-3524eecb-2a1c-4269-86a6-e0ce25acf0cd" label="text-like">MIDNIGHT MASS.</l><l xml:id="m-b2b30c99-98bc-4b7a-ac76-640745d6bb37" facs="#m-7a7160fa-f1e5-421d-abf6-981123d399c1" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-6631c58f-a5ed-4976-9341-4e5ccbf5cd63" facs="#m-5f08e4d1-6ead-41b5-8cc1-54bf9847f7b1" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-dd8ad6b0-25c9-4864-89cb-5eabce761b81" facs="#m-73fc5e91-641d-411a-92ee-db141b7fc2de" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-835ea8b9-c373-4cd3-a0d2-062c141079c5" facs="#m-a162a8ac-a6bc-4d02-8145-baf28cd8d146" label="lyrics-like">O-mi- nus “ dí-xit ad me: Fí- li- us mé¬ us</l><l xml:id="m-1317e0c4-ce21-4974-b8e3-1bbb8dd49396" facs="#m-8dd3c981-169c-4d58-ab10-d5cc0ceb21c1" label="lyrics-like">es tu, é-go hó¬ di-e gé-nu-i te. Ps. Quare</l><l xml:id="m-b9640d42-1d37-4fbf-8a22-ba97ee49e35d" facs="#m-0531e389-1a32-4b2f-aa60-b5dc61163876" label="lyrics-like">fremu-érunt géntes :“ et pópu-li medi-tá-ti sunt in-áni¬a</l><l xml:id="m-ecba4e28-8b28-4991-ab04-b76450c3c163" facs="#m-96fd2fc7-3de4-4cf1-84b4-40bf28f29523" label="lyrics-like">Gló-ri- a Pátri. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-4f0254aa-cdf5-4ed8-b557-73da9762bb58" facs="#m-03d04ebc-d501-4d18-9f54-2aa415a4670c" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-cb4b1dfe-75d9-4569-88f8-9cd6c83c5c8e" facs="#m-8d0e40b3-b6e0-42eb-a478-260acf7ed1b1" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui hanc sacratíssimam no¬lut cujus lucis mystéria in terra co¬</l><l xml:id="m-0a84538b-ddf2-4eb4-9d8f-08ec660df2bf" facs="#m-ad2a5c11-e68e-4876-8383-5a7f6167d157" label="lyrics-like">Uctem veri lúminis fecisti illustra¬ gnóvimus, “ ejus quoque gáudiis in</l><l xml:id="m-9d5231ec-2d18-4742-be54-235197ac609e" facs="#m-6f5f1210-6bb8-4588-92d4-b8796c3ae419" label="lyrics-like">tióne claréscere: t da, quaésumus; l caelo perfruámur : Qui tecum vivit.</l><l xml:id="m-651300e0-08e2-47be-89de-d58604a3161f" facs="#m-5f05e8fa-5e26-48d8-ac1e-644e85553679" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Titum. Tit. 2. c.</l><l xml:id="m-b419bef7-98c1-4244-820e-ed2e9a7966c4" facs="#m-2848e8e9-3b26-440c-b5cc-3aa6ac866766" label="lyrics-like">(Arissime: Appáruit grátia Dei] Dei et Salvatóris nostri Jesu Christi:</l><l xml:id="m-c2ab6bc9-287f-4496-b4b3-d8c10f8fe135" facs="#m-2c336a1b-b231-4b7f-9b05-88032615b493" label="lyrics-like">LSalvatóris nostri ómnibus homi¬</l><l xml:id="m-59c0f642-bdd9-4c5a-95de-e70789d8ca5b" facs="#m-c6c96371-de62-4e18-a0d1-5910aa582737" label="lyrics-like">qui dedit semetípsum pro nobis: ut</l><l xml:id="m-17f58e55-6718-46c6-aa98-08dff3158651" facs="#m-6fa2d48a-af78-429c-9c5a-0fcc342e9c6d" label="lyrics-like">nos redimeret ab omni iniquitáte, et</l><l xml:id="m-2502955c-b4f6-402a-8b4f-dba612312d47" facs="#m-809ceb66-776c-4d46-b504-82001ace325b" label="lyrics-like">nibus, erúdiens nos, ut abnegántes</l><l xml:id="m-18c116c3-bb35-46ae-9654-31395869beb8" facs="#m-99d8a838-a36b-4950-979f-041430dce70e" label="lyrics-like">impietátem, et saeculária desidéria,</l><l xml:id="m-05f25baf-a1df-47f3-8ef8-320f2b6d846b" facs="#m-1f0ba5fa-669a-406b-a1b8-0db13e5b7ee3" label="lyrics-like">mundáret sibi pópulum acceptábi¬</l><l xml:id="m-a2125bfe-ff4e-4e17-93c2-d2abf2af782a" facs="#m-9d171162-d424-493b-b978-d5cd6195d604" label="lyrics-like">sóbrie, et juste, et pie vivámus in</l><l xml:id="m-116e2504-03b4-484a-87ad-90e6b5ae739c" facs="#m-7228e662-fe69-432b-a0a7-947c595c165b" label="lyrics-like">lem, sectatórem bonórum óperum.</l><l xml:id="m-fb03160e-8fcf-491c-bb1f-800801d18b86" facs="#m-10222c24-ea9f-4f03-99cf-2a94fd032b92" label="lyrics-like">Haëc lóquere, et exhortáre: in</l><l xml:id="m-d526a4be-c05f-4b8e-a183-5caa50282739" facs="#m-0501f921-be9d-4434-978e-28b16c7d875c" label="lyrics-like">hoc saéculo, exspectántes beatam</l><l xml:id="m-7e44f006-5afe-4c15-98c1-da7fa813d195" facs="#m-b4a284aa-5bfb-4660-8cbc-97a37355de58" label="lyrics-like">spem, et advéntum glóriae magni !Christo Jesu Dómino nostro.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>